<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team about your experience boarding QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our Dangerous Goods Policy</strong><br />
<br />
To make sure your travel is comfortable and safe, we ask that your baggage comply with our Dangerous Goods Policy.<br />
<br />
Dangerous Goods are items that could endanger the safety of an aircraft or people on board the aircraft, and their carriage is governed by the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the Civil Aviation Safety Authority Regulations.<br />
<br />
<strong>Your safety is our top priority</strong><br />
<br />
Our customers’ wellbeing is at the core of everything we do, and we never compromise on safety.<br />
<br />
I understand that you may not have been aware of the rules around <strong><em>&lt;item&gt; </em></strong>being taken on board and appreciate your disappointment when it had to be <em><strong>&lt;checked-in/ surrendered&gt;</strong></em>.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If staff were rude add:</em></strong><br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear that our staff weren’t as courteous as expected — I want to assure you that I’ve passed this information on to our Airport Management to take up with the staff working on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the relevant team.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience — we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
